==============================================================================
Bliss rendering stack — forked from Blitz
==============================================================================

crates/bliss, crates/bliss-dom, crates/bliss-html, crates/bliss-net,
crates/bliss-paint, crates/bliss-shell, crates/bliss-traits,
crates/stylo_taffy, crates/debug_timer, crates/accesskit_xplat

These crates are a hard fork of Blitz by Dioxus Labs, carried in this
repository with Arniko's modifications. The standalone fork is
https://github.com/nixpt/bliss-engine.

  Upstream:   https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz
  Copyright:  Dioxus Labs and the Blitz contributors
  License:    MIT OR Apache-2.0
              stylo_taffy: MIT OR Apache-2.0 OR MPL-2.0 (LICENSE-MPL)
              accesskit_xplat: Apache-2.0 (crates/accesskit_xplat/LICENSE-APACHE)

Blitz in turn builds on Servo's Stylo CSS engine (MPL-2.0), DioxusLabs Taffy
and Linebender's Parley and Vello (used as dependencies). The checkbox tick
drawing in crates/bliss-paint/src/render/form_controls.rs is derived from
Linebender Masonry (https://github.com/linebender/xilem, Apache-2.0), as
inherited from upstream Blitz.

