==============================================================================
Tornado TUI crates (extracted)
==============================================================================

The `tornado`/`tornado-*` TUI toolkit crates were extracted to their own
repository and renamed `tui-easy`: https://github.com/nixpt/tui-easy
(carries the full history and upstream attribution for these crates).

==============================================================================
exo-mesh (vendored source, not built)
==============================================================================

crates/_vendored/exo-mesh is vendored from Exosphere's mesh transport, which
Exosphere licenses under the OpenKO Cooperative Protocol License 1.1 as a
runtime-tier crate. It is licensed OCPL-1.1, not MIT/Apache-2.0; the license
text is crates/_vendored/exo-mesh/LICENSE. No Arniko crate currently depends on
it (the `networking` feature uses exo-bliss-net), so it is not part of any
published crate.
